WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.434
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.834
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.834 --> 00:00:05.200
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.467
President Biden made a surprise
trip last week to Ukraine

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.501
by taking a 10-hour train ride,

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:12.467
or as the guy next to him
thought,

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.334
an 80-hour train ride.

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:18.934
President Biden reportedly
had a difficult time sleeping

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:21.968
last week on the overnight train
ride from Poland to Ukraine

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:24.901
and read a briefing memo
on the history of Kyiv

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:28.234
and that didn't
put him to sleep?

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:29.634
That would have
put the last president

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:31.567
into a multi-year coma.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.367
In a new interview,
President Biden said

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.367
that he has
"other things to finish

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.934
before launching a full-blown
presidential campaign."

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:42.067
Like, for instance,
"Yellowstone."

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:44.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.334
According to a new report,
then-President Trump

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:49.467
was so upset with "Late Night"
host Jimmy Kimmel's criticism

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:50.567
that he asked
White House staffers

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:52.100
to call Disney executives.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.834
And he was apparently so upset
with me that he called my boss.

00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:58.467
-That's right, Seth.
I told him to get lost.

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:00.567
[ Laughter ]
-Good looking out, Wally.

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:03.033
Thank you.
-You're welcome. Yep.

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:05.968
-Vice President Kamala Harris
spoke today in South Carolina

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.300
about the Biden
administration's expansion

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.267
of high-speed Internet access.

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.400
Although, it didn't help matters

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:13.767
that the live stream
started like this.

00:01:13.767 --> 00:01:16.634
[ Modem dialing ]

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:19.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:22.968
[ Dialing stops ]

00:01:22.968 --> 00:01:25.033
An-n-n-nd we're live.

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:26.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.868
House Republicans reportedly
planning to hold hearings

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:30.667
on the Biden administration's
response

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:33.701
to the toxic train wreck
in East Palestine, Ohio.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.567
And one way or another,
they're going to figure out

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:38.534
how Hunter Biden
sabotaged that train.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:40.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.200
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis'
book "The Courage to be Free"

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.901
is set to be released tomorrow.

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:48.000
Look for it
wherever books are legal.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:54.901
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
held a three-day retreat

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:57.267
over the weekend for top donors
and supporters

00:01:57.267 --> 00:01:58.834
at the Four Seasons
in Palm Beach.

00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:01.901
For a $10,000 donation,
you got to meet him.

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:04.334
And for $20,000, you didn't.

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:07.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.601 --> 00:02:09.267
An alligator
was recently captured

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:12.133
in Brooklyn's Prospect Park
and taken to the Bronx Zoo.

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:15.000
You made it move from Brooklyn
to the Bronx?

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:19.234
At least try turn it into boots
and let it die with dignity.

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:23.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.901
Firefighters in North Carolina

00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:27.534
recently rescued
a newlywed couple

00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:30.000
that got stuck
in an elevator for 2.5 hours

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.000
after their wedding.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.234
The couple is doing fine

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:34.434
and ready to get on
with their divorce.

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:39.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.167 --> 00:02:41.667
And finally, a woman in Georgia
was arrested last week

00:02:41.667 --> 00:02:44.834
after she allegedly drove her
car into a Popeyes restaurant

00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:47.133
because her order
did not have biscuits.

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.534
Apparently, those biscuits

00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:52.000
are the only thing that
take the edge off the meth.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.234
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:57.300
We're off and running.
[ Cheers and applause ]

